WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.840
Welcome back.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.400
You have your M.V.P. and your 90-day game plan.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.400
But a plan is just a piece of paper until it meets reality.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.920
Pressure is where leadership is revealed.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.400
This week is about activating your M.V.P. when it matters most.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.340
When the pressure is on, deadlines are tight, and the stakes are high.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.780
In our next segment, we'll start by building your own resilience playbook.
